WEBVTT

01:49.570 --> 01:55.000
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.039 --> 01:57.890
[Episode 11]

01:58.350 --> 02:01.070
[19 years ago]

02:18.360 --> 02:19.520
Hurry, go. Hurry.

02:19.520 --> 02:20.240
Okay, okay.

02:32.150 --> 02:32.800
Oh no!

02:33.890 --> 02:34.540
Yimeng!

02:34.840 --> 02:35.590
Don't go in!

02:35.590 --> 02:36.470
It's dangerous inside.

02:36.470 --> 02:37.750
There are still people in there!

02:37.750 --> 02:38.910
Li Shiliu is in there too.

02:38.910 --> 02:39.680
Li Shiliu?

02:39.870 --> 02:41.440
Get ready to make the arrest!

02:41.440 --> 02:42.710
You're still thinking about

02:42.710 --> 02:43.630
arresting someone now?

02:43.630 --> 02:45.030
You should be saving people!

02:45.030 --> 02:45.840
Chu Guihong!

02:45.910 --> 02:46.710
Yimeng.

02:46.710 --> 02:47.630
Arresting the unidentified assassin

02:47.630 --> 02:49.560
is the Qianyu Army's duty tonight.

02:53.450 --> 02:57.900
♪ I'm willing to go with the wind ♪

02:58.630 --> 03:01.560
♪ Pure of heart,
roaming free across the lands ♪

03:02.410 --> 03:05.220
♪ No waiting, no hate,
I write my own story ♪

03:06.040 --> 03:08.630
♪ I give my all for what I believe in ♪

03:09.610 --> 03:13.400
♪ I'm willing to go with the wind ♪

03:12.800 --> 03:13.680
Mr. Li!

03:13.750 --> 03:14.420
Come.

03:14.050 --> 03:17.130
♪ And run into the fog with no regrets ♪

03:14.840 --> 03:16.240
Take these two kids away.

03:16.520 --> 03:17.880
You did it, Mr. Li!

03:18.110 --> 03:21.160
♪ Even if rain pours on the path ahead ♪

03:20.280 --> 03:21.000
Kid.

03:21.000 --> 03:22.000
Don't cry, don't cry.

03:22.000 --> 03:22.840
You're safe now.

03:22.110 --> 03:24.610
♪ For this life, for all beings ♪

03:22.840 --> 03:23.590
Kid.

03:24.360 --> 03:25.030
Thank you, thank you!

03:25.030 --> 03:26.680
Granny, take them back now.

03:25.040 --> 03:27.570
♪ Sweeping through a thousand years
of dust ♪

03:26.680 --> 03:27.400
Thank you.

03:28.710 --> 03:29.310
Let's go.

03:30.680 --> 03:32.840
Mr. Li, are you hurt?

03:32.840 --> 03:33.590
Are you alright?

03:33.590 --> 03:34.850
I'm fine. Don't worry.

03:35.230 --> 03:36.130
That's great.

03:41.240 --> 03:42.090
General,

03:42.240 --> 03:43.770
should we still arrest him?

04:00.510 --> 04:01.500
Li Shiliu,

04:02.000 --> 04:04.080
you're suspected
of trying to assassinate a prince

04:04.080 --> 04:06.010
and disrupt the Lantern Festival.

04:06.310 --> 04:08.560
I can't let you twist the truth

04:08.590 --> 04:09.650
and play hero here.

04:10.360 --> 04:11.760
Well, well, Chu Guihong,

04:12.080 --> 04:14.100
you switched sides and broke your word.

04:14.100 --> 04:16.230
Yet you have the audacity to pursue me.

04:25.070 --> 04:26.330
I'm just doing my duty.

04:26.680 --> 04:27.720
Drop your weapon

04:27.720 --> 04:28.650
and come with me.

04:30.560 --> 04:31.630
What if I refuse?

04:35.560 --> 04:37.690
Then don't blame me if I show no mercy.

04:38.750 --> 04:39.560
Chu Guihong.

04:41.800 --> 04:43.610
You think you can take me down

04:43.870 --> 04:45.080
with that

04:45.830 --> 04:47.030
lousy sword of yours?

04:49.260 --> 04:51.000
The Qianyu Moon-Cleaving Blade

04:51.000 --> 04:52.159
is forged 100 times

04:52.440 --> 04:54.300
and cuts through iron like paper.

04:54.990 --> 04:56.120
What a coincidence.

04:57.870 --> 04:58.920
My weapon

05:00.140 --> 05:01.800
is forged from dark steel too.

05:01.800 --> 05:03.600
There's nothing it can't break.

05:03.630 --> 05:04.240
Come on.

05:05.160 --> 05:06.220
Let's try them out.

05:33.050 --> 05:35.440
That sword's quality isn't very good.

05:39.030 --> 05:40.370
Not my fault.

05:44.500 --> 05:45.470
Impossible.

05:47.420 --> 05:48.640
This is impossible.

05:49.070 --> 05:50.330
Prepare to arrest him!

05:51.830 --> 05:53.720
Chief, we're here.

05:58.510 --> 06:01.480
♪ Phantom dragon
lurks in the black market ♪

06:03.020 --> 06:06.470
♪ Radiant lanterns
illuminate the Nightwalkers ♪

06:06.160 --> 06:06.950
Chief.

06:07.480 --> 06:08.310
We're here.

06:08.800 --> 06:10.310
We set off as soon as we got the word.

06:09.110 --> 06:11.000
♪ In the dark of night,
pure dreams run deep and wide ♪

06:10.310 --> 06:11.600
We're not too late, are we?

06:11.600 --> 06:12.680
Cut the crap.

06:11.690 --> 06:13.600
♪ Who dares to join the game?
This isn't child's play ♪

06:13.120 --> 06:14.160
Boys,

06:14.120 --> 06:16.630
♪ Footsteps that shake the sky,
fear refuses to fade ♪

06:14.430 --> 06:15.260
put out the fire!

06:15.260 --> 06:17.510
Yes, yes, yes!

06:17.260 --> 06:19.090
♪ Every punch lands
hard on this wild melody ♪

06:19.530 --> 06:21.490
♪ I ride on the wind
of the waning river crescent ♪

06:22.150 --> 06:23.980
♪ Hate the injustice in the world ♪

06:24.690 --> 06:26.370
♪ Loyalty and righteousness
weigh on both sides of the scale ♪

06:26.810 --> 06:28.430
That's badass.

06:27.060 --> 06:30.030
♪ Wield the knife
to carve a rift in the hell ♪

06:38.540 --> 06:40.000
What are you all standing around for?

06:40.000 --> 06:41.270
Go put out that fire!

06:42.159 --> 06:42.950
General,

06:43.159 --> 06:44.290
how about we…

06:44.430 --> 06:45.270
No way.

06:45.950 --> 06:46.880
Are you alright?

06:47.800 --> 06:48.630
I know

06:49.270 --> 06:51.400
this sword was a gift from your father.

06:51.540 --> 06:54.740
But putting out the fire
is what really matters right now.

06:55.510 --> 06:56.510
Someone must've

06:56.760 --> 06:58.240
swapped out my sword in secret.

06:58.240 --> 06:58.950
You...

07:01.950 --> 07:03.750
If the fire spreads any further,

07:03.870 --> 07:04.950
the people living nearby

07:04.950 --> 07:06.430
will all be in danger.

07:06.430 --> 07:07.310
At a time like this,

07:07.310 --> 07:08.940
you're still worrying about your sword?

07:08.940 --> 07:10.290
Take a look for yourself.

07:10.290 --> 07:12.120
The man you want
is in there, fighting the fire.

07:12.120 --> 07:13.190
He hasn't run.

07:13.190 --> 07:15.000
He's risking his life in there.

07:15.120 --> 07:16.850
And what are you doing out here?

07:25.690 --> 07:26.770
This way, quick!

07:48.740 --> 07:50.000
Put out the fire first!

07:58.710 --> 07:59.930
That's more like it.

08:10.390 --> 08:11.650
It was a fine sword.

08:12.190 --> 08:13.920
It'd be a shame to throw it away.

08:15.710 --> 08:18.110
I might as well keep it
for crushing garlic.

08:22.830 --> 08:24.820
Mr. Li, I'm coming to help you.

08:25.850 --> 08:28.280
[Laiyi House]

08:25.980 --> 08:28.440
Nan Rui set fire to the oil shop?

08:29.090 --> 08:30.360
That can't be true!

08:30.450 --> 08:31.210
It is.

08:31.240 --> 08:32.510
Word has spread all over the capital.

08:32.510 --> 08:34.360
They say the Eighteenth Prince got drunk,

08:34.360 --> 08:35.440
accidentally

08:35.440 --> 08:36.240
lit fireworks,

08:36.240 --> 08:37.270
and set the oil shop on fire.

08:37.270 --> 08:38.870
That's how the fire started.

08:39.480 --> 08:41.150
How could it be Nan Rui?

08:41.630 --> 08:42.760
That's impossible.

08:43.030 --> 08:44.100
According to the plot,

08:44.100 --> 08:45.810
it should've been Nan Heng.

08:46.320 --> 08:47.420
Could it be that

08:47.750 --> 08:48.750
Li Shiliu has

08:48.910 --> 08:50.570
changed the storyline again?

08:54.130 --> 08:55.320
No need for this.

08:55.320 --> 08:56.080
I'm heading out.

08:56.080 --> 08:56.870
My Lady,

08:56.960 --> 08:58.360
you can't go out now.

08:58.360 --> 08:59.670
The streets are in chaos.

08:59.670 --> 09:01.000
Fire victims are demanding that

09:01.000 --> 09:02.740
His Majesty
thoroughly investigate the incident.

09:02.740 --> 09:04.340
You might get caught up in it.

09:04.670 --> 09:05.480
But...

09:05.750 --> 09:06.550
My Lady.

09:06.720 --> 09:07.390
My Lady.

09:08.460 --> 09:09.790
Master wants to see you.

09:13.360 --> 09:15.360
Father, I know I was wrong.

09:15.390 --> 09:16.200
I truly messed up.

09:16.200 --> 09:16.930
Your Highness,

09:16.930 --> 09:19.120
the Eighteenth Prince
has been in there for four hours.

09:19.120 --> 09:19.910
Looks like he's getting

09:19.910 --> 09:20.790
chewed out this time.

09:20.790 --> 09:21.510
Father.

09:23.000 --> 09:25.230
What punishment do you think
His Majesty will give him?

09:25.230 --> 09:26.120
Grounding?

09:26.750 --> 09:27.670
Too lenient.

09:27.960 --> 09:29.150
Docking his stipend?

09:29.150 --> 09:30.630
Doesn't feel right either.

09:30.630 --> 09:32.270
He's not going to behead him, is he?

09:32.270 --> 09:32.910
I...

09:44.390 --> 09:46.750
Comparison really is the thief of joy.

09:47.700 --> 09:49.440
Back then, we were both

09:49.440 --> 09:51.030
just page boys for the princes.

09:51.030 --> 09:52.150
Picking the right master

09:52.150 --> 09:53.790
really made all the difference.

09:53.790 --> 09:55.000
Look at you now—

09:55.550 --> 09:56.840
then look at me.

09:59.350 --> 10:03.080
[Imperial Study]

10:03.920 --> 10:04.780
Your Highness,

10:04.960 --> 10:06.360
His Majesty summons you.

10:09.940 --> 10:12.470
[Good Virtues]

10:15.850 --> 10:18.050
Strength, restraint.

10:18.510 --> 10:21.070
Hide your edge, show your edge.

10:21.400 --> 10:23.630
What kind of persona
is my father going for?

10:23.630 --> 10:24.440
Yimeng.

10:24.380 --> 10:25.580
[Good Virtues]

10:31.670 --> 10:33.510
Green tea on one side,

10:34.270 --> 10:35.530
black tea on the other.

10:37.380 --> 10:39.240
A master of keeping balance, huh?

10:40.840 --> 10:41.630
Father.

10:42.750 --> 10:43.830
Is there

10:44.390 --> 10:45.990
some deeper meaning to this?

10:46.120 --> 10:48.850
Why drink green tea
and black tea at the same time?

10:49.270 --> 10:50.790
I've told you before.

10:50.790 --> 10:52.390
Have you forgotten already?

10:54.780 --> 10:55.690
Tell me—

10:56.690 --> 10:58.870
what's the most important thing in life?

10:58.870 --> 11:00.360
Enjoy yourself.

11:00.360 --> 11:01.120
Wrong.

11:02.670 --> 11:04.320
Let me tell you again.

11:04.860 --> 11:06.210
One cup of black tea

11:06.760 --> 11:08.090
and one cup of green tea.

11:08.360 --> 11:10.000
I sip from one cup

11:11.720 --> 11:12.980
and then try the other.

11:13.550 --> 11:15.030
This way, no one

11:16.000 --> 11:17.860
can figure out what I really like.

11:21.960 --> 11:23.080
Impressive.

11:23.720 --> 11:24.930
No wonder

11:24.960 --> 11:25.960
you're the one

11:26.000 --> 11:27.480
His Majesty trusts most in court,

11:27.480 --> 11:29.050
Mr. Song.

11:29.080 --> 11:30.480
You really know your stuff.

11:30.480 --> 11:31.720
Of course.

11:32.360 --> 11:33.150
You've still

11:33.790 --> 11:35.670
got a lot to learn

11:35.720 --> 11:36.720
from your old man.

11:51.240 --> 11:52.140
Father,

11:52.320 --> 11:54.910
why are you staring at me like that?

11:55.150 --> 11:56.680
There was a fire last night.

11:56.910 --> 11:59.790
Didn't Chu Guihong
say anything to you about it?

12:02.950 --> 12:05.790
Was he supposed to?

12:05.790 --> 12:07.670
Wasn't he supposed to?

12:08.870 --> 12:09.730
He was supposed

12:09.870 --> 12:11.060
to say something?

12:11.200 --> 12:12.790
Wasn't he supposed to?

12:15.530 --> 12:17.590
Father, what exactly are you asking?

12:19.590 --> 12:21.580
The whole court's saying that

12:22.600 --> 12:26.550
the Eighteenth Prince
conspired with Chu Guihong to set the fire

12:26.570 --> 12:29.020
and to assassinate the Seventh Prince.

12:30.910 --> 12:32.700
Nan Rui tried to kill Nan Heng?

12:33.030 --> 12:34.430
Who said that?

12:34.450 --> 12:36.030
That's nonsense.

12:36.650 --> 12:38.780
His Majesty thinks so too.

12:39.200 --> 12:40.430
In fact, His Majesty

12:40.480 --> 12:41.630
believes this rumor

12:41.630 --> 12:43.960
was spread by the Seventh Prince himself.

13:15.750 --> 13:18.410
They say the assassin
who came for you last night

13:18.480 --> 13:20.140
was a martial-world ruffian.

13:21.000 --> 13:22.360
Do you know him?

13:25.320 --> 13:26.120
Your Majesty,

13:26.870 --> 13:27.790
I would never

13:28.000 --> 13:30.090
associate with such despicable people.

13:30.090 --> 13:31.670
Don't play dumb with me.

13:34.000 --> 13:37.260
I've ordered Chu Guihong
to investigate this thoroughly.

13:38.870 --> 13:39.670
Your Majesty,

13:40.150 --> 13:42.720
rumors are swirling
throughout the court today.

13:42.720 --> 13:43.720
I wonder if you've

13:43.910 --> 13:44.910
heard any of them.

13:45.080 --> 13:46.460
What are rumors?

13:46.870 --> 13:49.020
They're just baseless hearsay.

13:49.240 --> 13:51.100
And you dare bring that up with me?

13:52.390 --> 13:53.200
Yeah,

13:53.840 --> 13:55.510
but I want to get to the bottom of it

13:55.510 --> 13:56.770
and uncover the truth.

14:00.230 --> 14:01.890
Get to the bottom of it?

14:02.630 --> 14:04.120
What if the source of that rumor

14:04.120 --> 14:05.650
is you?

14:08.630 --> 14:09.560
Then I'm willing

14:09.970 --> 14:11.630
to take my own life as penance.

14:15.820 --> 14:18.480
[Vastness]

14:16.630 --> 14:17.440
Very well!

14:17.900 --> 14:19.300
You'd take your own life?

14:32.140 --> 14:33.510
Get up and answer me.

14:37.320 --> 14:39.680
Even if you didn't start the rumor,

14:40.050 --> 14:41.920
you're still not innocent.

14:43.230 --> 14:44.360
Haven't you always suspected

14:44.360 --> 14:45.840
that Rui wants to kill you?

14:47.120 --> 14:47.910
Fine.

14:48.480 --> 14:49.750
Let's find out today

14:49.750 --> 14:51.360
if he dares kill you!

14:53.320 --> 14:54.120
Rui,

14:54.140 --> 14:55.280
kill him.

14:55.310 --> 14:56.440
No, no, Father!

14:56.440 --> 14:57.600
I don't dare kill anyone.

14:57.600 --> 14:57.960
Take it!

14:57.960 --> 14:59.320
No, no, I can't!

14:59.320 --> 15:00.150
I-I don't dare!

15:00.150 --> 15:00.670
Kill him!

15:00.670 --> 15:02.390
I can't, I can't!

15:02.390 --> 15:04.360
-I'll back you up.
-I can't, I can't!

15:04.360 --> 15:05.220
I really can't.

15:08.880 --> 15:15.780
[Pure of Heart]

15:14.510 --> 15:15.480
Get up.

15:23.510 --> 15:24.720
Did you see that?

15:26.320 --> 15:27.870
Rui has never even dared

15:27.870 --> 15:29.870
to kill a chicken in his entire life.

15:30.390 --> 15:31.720
You think he'd kill you?

15:35.910 --> 15:38.440
You're the famous God of Death.

15:38.870 --> 15:40.600
Even I feel a chill

15:40.600 --> 15:42.390
when I hear that name.

15:46.270 --> 15:47.330
Don't get me wrong.

15:47.930 --> 15:50.150
Please let me look into the assassination

15:50.150 --> 15:51.670
and clear Rui's name.

15:52.790 --> 15:54.120
So, after all this talk,

15:54.630 --> 15:57.430
you just don't want
Chu Guihong to investigate it.

16:01.160 --> 16:04.160
Looks to me like
you're the one with something to hide!

16:06.550 --> 16:07.690
I wouldn't dare.

16:12.880 --> 16:14.070
If you want to investigate it,

16:14.070 --> 16:15.380
go ahead.

16:16.600 --> 16:17.840
Let's see

16:17.840 --> 16:19.550
what tricks you'll pull.

16:21.500 --> 16:22.810
Thank you, Your Majesty.

16:22.810 --> 16:25.410
[Vastness]

16:26.240 --> 16:27.040
Your Majesty.

16:28.720 --> 16:30.200
I have one more request.

16:30.200 --> 16:30.840
Say it.

16:32.200 --> 16:33.510
The fire in the southern part of the city

16:33.510 --> 16:35.670
damaged many homes and shops.

16:36.330 --> 16:37.780
The people are hoping you'll punish

16:37.780 --> 16:39.000
whoever caused it.

16:40.440 --> 16:42.220
You want me to punish Rui?

16:43.860 --> 16:44.800
I wouldn't dare.

16:45.600 --> 16:47.010
I know how deeply

16:47.120 --> 16:48.960
you care for Rui.

16:50.270 --> 16:51.080
So,

16:52.000 --> 16:53.650
I'm willing
to shoulder the blame for him

16:53.650 --> 16:55.120
and personally oversee

16:55.560 --> 16:57.890
the reconstruction in the affected area.

16:58.000 --> 16:59.150
No, no, no.

16:59.150 --> 16:59.870
Father,

17:00.210 --> 17:01.510
h-he's definitely not that kindhearted!

17:01.510 --> 17:02.830
Why would he help me?

17:02.910 --> 17:04.270
He must be up to something.

17:04.270 --> 17:05.030
Father, he...

17:05.030 --> 17:05.750
Enough.

17:06.480 --> 17:07.270
He…

17:12.599 --> 17:15.130
You don't have to
concern yourself with this.

17:15.160 --> 17:17.030
Chu Guihong is the capital prefect.

17:17.030 --> 17:18.690
He's always been meticulous.

17:18.700 --> 17:21.130
He'll handle the repairs and rebuilding.

17:22.310 --> 17:24.750
Thank you on Guihong's behalf, Father.

17:42.090 --> 17:45.030
[Nan Heng, Nan Rui]

17:42.440 --> 17:44.030
I really don't get it.

17:44.510 --> 17:46.720
Aren't they both His Majesty's sons?

17:47.350 --> 17:49.950
Why does His Majesty
play favorites like this?

17:52.590 --> 17:54.160
Could it be because of

17:54.400 --> 17:56.510
the Empress's unexpected death back then?

17:56.510 --> 17:57.750
Keep your voice down.

18:00.270 --> 18:01.750
Don't worry, Father.

18:01.830 --> 18:03.960
Didn't you just
shut all the doors and windows?

18:03.960 --> 18:05.070
No one can hear us.

18:06.720 --> 18:07.510
You

18:07.830 --> 18:09.680
are too naive.

18:10.200 --> 18:10.720
Today,

18:10.720 --> 18:13.790
I'll break down the art
of political intrigue for you.

18:15.920 --> 18:17.960
The Lantern Festival should have been

18:17.960 --> 18:20.960
a surefire play for Chu Guihong
to seize command of all palace forces,

18:20.960 --> 18:23.890
inside and out,
and keep the Seventh Prince in check.

18:24.110 --> 18:25.570
If nothing had gone wrong,

18:25.790 --> 18:27.810
His Majesty would've
cleared the path for him

18:27.810 --> 18:30.210
so he could assist
the future crown prince:

18:30.750 --> 18:31.590
Nan Rui.

18:33.000 --> 18:34.360
But now,

18:34.380 --> 18:36.640
who has benefited the most from all this?

18:41.580 --> 18:42.380
Nan Heng.

18:42.860 --> 18:44.120
[Nan Heng, Nan Rui]

18:43.240 --> 18:44.210
Exactly!

18:45.240 --> 18:46.640
Then think about this.

18:48.240 --> 18:49.170
Last night,

18:49.180 --> 18:51.380
[Nan Heng, Nan Rui]

18:49.360 --> 18:51.290
Nan Rui set the fire.

18:55.420 --> 18:58.080
Why would
the Eighteenth Prince set a fire?

18:58.590 --> 18:59.240
Because he…

18:59.240 --> 19:00.740
Because he was drunk.

19:01.640 --> 19:03.590
And why was he drunk?

19:03.830 --> 19:04.590
Because…

19:04.590 --> 19:05.920
Because he got scolded.

19:06.550 --> 19:07.700
Who scolded him?

19:08.680 --> 19:10.710
The Seventh Prince did.

19:10.890 --> 19:13.960
And why did the Seventh Prince scold him?

19:14.750 --> 19:17.940
Because you showed up on the tower.

19:20.640 --> 19:21.430
Yeah.

19:22.720 --> 19:24.640
Why did you go up there last night?

19:26.070 --> 19:27.640
Is that really the point, Father?

19:27.640 --> 19:28.550
Weren't you supposed

19:28.550 --> 19:30.160
to break down
the political intrigue for me?

19:30.160 --> 19:31.160
Keep going.

19:32.200 --> 19:33.180
Right, right.

19:33.370 --> 19:34.780
Let's get back to it.

19:35.040 --> 19:36.350
To sum it all up,

19:36.370 --> 19:37.700
Nan Rui setting the fire

19:37.710 --> 19:38.730
must've been part of

19:38.730 --> 19:40.380
the Seventh Prince's scheme.

19:38.790 --> 19:40.170
[Nan Heng, Nan Rui]

19:40.440 --> 19:41.720
That was a scheme?

19:42.040 --> 19:43.790
He might nail the timing and place,

19:43.790 --> 19:46.590
but could he really
have foreseen Nan Rui starting a fire?

19:46.590 --> 19:47.350
You...

19:47.350 --> 19:48.510
If you keep thinking so simply,

19:48.510 --> 19:50.640
how can I ever stop worrying about you?

19:50.640 --> 19:53.160
You can't afford
to see people as innocent.

19:55.030 --> 19:55.980
Father,

19:56.010 --> 19:57.450
by your logic,

19:57.470 --> 19:59.560
So Nan Heng arranged

19:59.820 --> 20:01.780
the attack on himself, too?

20:06.000 --> 20:06.790
Yeah.

20:08.160 --> 20:10.880
Nan Heng staged
an assassination attempt on himself.

20:10.880 --> 20:12.550
That's a solid theory.

20:13.850 --> 20:15.040
Stop, stop, stop.

20:15.060 --> 20:16.620
Father, that's enough.

20:17.660 --> 20:20.170
Maybe you'd better
steer clear of politics.

20:20.240 --> 20:21.510
I'm starting to worry your hairline

20:21.510 --> 20:23.840
is going to
bail on you early over all this.

20:24.350 --> 20:25.720
What does that mean?

20:27.720 --> 20:29.160
Does His Majesty see

20:29.160 --> 20:31.290
the Eighteenth Prince as his only son?

20:31.310 --> 20:33.240
The Eighteenth Prince set the fire.

20:33.240 --> 20:34.480
He got away unpunished,

20:34.480 --> 20:36.510
and when we offered to clean up the mess,

20:36.510 --> 20:39.240
His Majesty wanted
Chu Guihong to take care of it instead.

20:39.240 --> 20:40.250
Why?

20:41.960 --> 20:44.270
Last night's chaos at the Lantern Festival

20:44.270 --> 20:45.200
was an accident.

20:45.640 --> 20:47.400
I thought the matter was over,

20:48.240 --> 20:49.920
but somehow Nan Rui

20:50.000 --> 20:52.510
still managed to stir things up.

20:53.200 --> 20:55.200
So in the end, Song Yimeng's warning

20:55.750 --> 20:58.350
about the chaos last night
actually came true.

20:58.880 --> 21:00.680
Don't you think that's a bit suspicious?

21:00.680 --> 21:03.210
So Song Yimeng is the one
pulling the strings?

21:03.590 --> 21:05.510
She's your real enemy
hiding in the shadows?

21:05.510 --> 21:06.440
No way.

21:07.160 --> 21:08.200
You got proof?

21:08.680 --> 21:09.680
I don't need any.

21:10.280 --> 21:11.280
I know her.

21:12.480 --> 21:14.310
She'd never risk innocent lives

21:14.330 --> 21:15.480
to set a trap.

21:16.440 --> 21:17.550
Song Yimeng

21:17.550 --> 21:19.270
can control you with sorcery

21:19.270 --> 21:20.600
and predict the future.

21:20.810 --> 21:23.160
That woman's full of secrets.

21:23.190 --> 21:24.150
If you ask me,

21:24.170 --> 21:27.000
we'd better find out
what she's really up to.

21:32.470 --> 21:33.200
Your Highness,

21:33.200 --> 21:35.620
Miss Song Yimeng is here to see you.

21:36.000 --> 21:36.680
Oh no, oh no.

21:36.680 --> 21:37.830
Where are His Highness's mask, hat,

21:37.830 --> 21:38.640
and mechanical arm?

21:38.640 --> 21:40.440
This is the prince's residence.

21:43.070 --> 21:45.710
She's here to see the Seventh Prince.

21:45.970 --> 21:47.770
Then why aren't you heading out?

21:54.510 --> 21:56.350
I heard you went to the palace today.

21:56.350 --> 21:57.160
So?

21:57.380 --> 21:59.660
His Majesty didn't punish you, did he?

22:02.720 --> 22:04.120
That sounded sarcastic,

22:04.130 --> 22:06.080
like I came just to laugh at him.

22:06.640 --> 22:08.440
No, I need a different approach.

22:10.550 --> 22:11.670
Your Highness,

22:11.830 --> 22:13.600
you were a victim

22:13.780 --> 22:16.040
in yesterday's assassination attempt.

22:16.680 --> 22:18.030
Are you hurt anywhere?

22:18.030 --> 22:19.070
Let me take a look.

22:19.510 --> 22:21.250
Seeing you like this

22:21.440 --> 22:22.790
really breaks

22:22.790 --> 22:25.860
my heart.

22:28.790 --> 22:29.990
Way too pretentious.

22:31.350 --> 22:32.210
Your Highness,

22:32.430 --> 22:35.130
I heard you're in charge of investigating

22:35.310 --> 22:36.890
yesterday's assassination attempt.

22:36.890 --> 22:38.570
Isn't it possible

22:38.680 --> 22:40.740
that it was just a misunderstanding?

22:41.920 --> 22:42.790
No, no.

22:42.830 --> 22:44.270
Too obvious.

22:44.270 --> 22:46.470
That'll just make him more suspicious.

22:46.970 --> 22:48.030
If all else fails,

22:48.830 --> 22:51.230
I'll have to use my ultimate move.

22:56.400 --> 22:57.550
Your Highness.

22:57.550 --> 22:58.310
What's the matter?

22:58.310 --> 22:58.880
I...

22:59.920 --> 23:00.480
Your...

23:00.480 --> 23:01.680
I haven't gone to find you,

23:01.680 --> 23:03.410
and you've come to me yourself.

23:04.030 --> 23:04.550
You…

23:04.550 --> 23:05.750
Are you disappointed

23:06.170 --> 23:07.700
to see that I'm still alive?

23:09.070 --> 23:09.880
I...

23:21.880 --> 23:22.550
Let me do it.

23:22.550 --> 23:23.200
Let me.

23:27.530 --> 23:28.620
Your Highness.

23:29.270 --> 23:31.200
I did something stupid last night.

23:31.270 --> 23:32.730
I acted without thinking.

23:32.750 --> 23:34.470
Can you forgive me?

23:35.680 --> 23:37.640
I almost died last night.

23:38.920 --> 23:40.450
How can I forgive you?

23:41.590 --> 23:44.600
You used to
want to kill me too, didn't you?

23:44.790 --> 23:46.390
And you tried more than once.

23:46.510 --> 23:48.550
So let's just…

23:49.640 --> 23:50.920
call it even.

23:56.920 --> 23:58.000
Your Highness.

23:59.250 --> 24:00.680
Your Highness.

24:00.790 --> 24:01.590
Let go.

24:11.680 --> 24:12.680
I know

24:13.070 --> 24:15.030
you went to the palace today

24:15.420 --> 24:17.220
and got chewed out pretty badly.

24:17.480 --> 24:20.550
You must be very frustrated.

24:21.070 --> 24:22.130
But Your Highness,

24:22.510 --> 24:24.050
you're magnanimous, right?

24:24.050 --> 24:26.720
So please just let it slide.

24:26.880 --> 24:28.350
Enough, drop the act.

24:28.830 --> 24:30.690
I know what kind of person you are.

24:31.590 --> 24:32.400
Spill it,

24:32.550 --> 24:33.880
what do you really want?

24:40.790 --> 24:41.590
Sorry!

24:46.510 --> 24:47.370
Your Highness.

24:48.440 --> 24:49.480
I'm really sorry.

24:50.780 --> 24:52.440
I planned the assassination.

24:52.640 --> 24:54.640
The Eighteenth Prince set the fire.

24:54.680 --> 24:55.880
You did nothing,

24:55.920 --> 24:57.320
yet you took all the heat.

24:57.790 --> 24:59.360
So I came today

24:59.750 --> 25:01.480
to apologize to you.

25:06.070 --> 25:08.130
Weren't you trying
to kill me only last night?

25:08.130 --> 25:09.990
Why come here to apologize today?

25:12.400 --> 25:13.640
Because...

25:15.830 --> 25:17.550
because you're human.

25:18.770 --> 25:20.570
You can feel wronged as well.

25:21.090 --> 25:22.480
When the grievances pile up,

25:22.480 --> 25:23.720
you grow indignant

25:23.770 --> 25:25.190
and go to extremes.

25:27.400 --> 25:29.030
In the past, the outside world

25:29.030 --> 25:30.290
was beyond my control,

25:30.770 --> 25:33.040
but now, inside my own script,

25:33.070 --> 25:34.630
I can't let anyone

25:34.650 --> 25:36.050
be wrongfully accused.

25:47.350 --> 25:48.160
Alright,

25:49.130 --> 25:50.260
I'll think about it.

25:53.720 --> 25:54.510
But

25:55.370 --> 25:57.230
it depends on how sincere you are.

25:59.030 --> 25:59.920
I knew it.

26:00.000 --> 26:01.110
Your Highness,

26:01.110 --> 26:02.240
you're both wise

26:02.240 --> 26:03.350
and magnanimous.

26:07.250 --> 26:08.940
So, Your Highness,

26:10.720 --> 26:11.850
how about Li Shiliu?

26:13.060 --> 26:15.250
Could you let him go too?

26:19.970 --> 26:22.400
You groveled and poured on the flattery

26:22.440 --> 26:24.570
just for that martial-world ruffian?

26:33.320 --> 26:35.050
You really care about him, huh?

26:39.640 --> 26:40.940
But what if I

26:41.140 --> 26:42.660
just refuse to spare him?

26:44.720 --> 26:45.890
No way!

26:46.070 --> 26:47.280
He's my man.

26:47.640 --> 26:49.240
Hurt him, and you hurt me.

26:54.750 --> 26:55.510
Your man?

26:55.540 --> 26:56.170
Yep!

26:56.830 --> 26:57.720
You lay a finger on him,

26:57.720 --> 26:59.310
and you're crossing the Song family.

26:59.310 --> 27:01.030
My family and I
are not to be underestimated.

27:01.030 --> 27:02.090
Don't mess with me!

27:11.350 --> 27:12.160
Fine.

27:14.240 --> 27:15.180
You can go now.

27:21.240 --> 27:22.400
Your Highness, you…

27:22.600 --> 27:23.930
What do you mean by that?

27:24.110 --> 27:26.350
Are you saying you'll spare him?

27:26.790 --> 27:27.890
Keep talking,

27:27.960 --> 27:29.920
and I'll have troops
raid Waning River Crescent

27:29.920 --> 27:31.510
and kill that Li Shiliu.

27:33.140 --> 27:34.740
Many thanks, Your Highness.

27:34.870 --> 27:36.470
Many thanks, Your Highness.

27:36.960 --> 27:38.160
Thank you, Your Highness.

27:38.160 --> 27:39.620
Thank you, Your Highness.

28:08.160 --> 28:09.290
But what if I

28:09.750 --> 28:11.460
just refuse to spare him?

28:11.490 --> 28:12.770
He's my man.

28:12.800 --> 28:15.310
You lay a finger on him,
and you're crossing the Song family.

28:15.310 --> 28:17.160
My family and I
are not to be underestimated.

28:17.160 --> 28:18.220
Don't mess with me!

29:12.640 --> 29:17.180
[Peace and Serenity]

29:32.790 --> 29:33.640
Fugui.

29:34.070 --> 29:35.850
We're colleagues, after all.

29:36.030 --> 29:36.750
Don't be so mean, okay?

29:36.750 --> 29:37.510
Stop.

29:37.510 --> 29:39.590
I grew up with His Highness.

29:40.070 --> 29:41.270
Back when I was his page,

29:41.270 --> 29:42.870
you were nowhere to be found.

29:43.000 --> 29:45.350
You sneak in
through the back door now and then,

29:45.350 --> 29:47.230
but I come and go through the front door.

29:47.230 --> 29:48.440
Don't think that strutting around

29:48.440 --> 29:50.750
with that stupid earring
that marks you as the Second Master

29:50.750 --> 29:52.070
of Waning River Crescent

29:52.070 --> 29:54.110
makes you my equal.

29:57.310 --> 29:58.640
Why are you shaking your head?

29:58.640 --> 29:59.570
What do you mean?

30:00.350 --> 30:01.240
Make it clear!

30:03.070 --> 30:03.960
Fugui,

30:03.980 --> 30:06.740
subordinates
who can't read the boss's mind

30:07.350 --> 30:09.920
get fired.

30:13.310 --> 30:15.270
Do I need to read minds?

30:15.540 --> 30:17.270
Whatever His Highness thinks…

30:17.950 --> 30:18.760
You...

30:20.790 --> 30:21.720
Where are you?

30:22.000 --> 30:22.880
Come back!

30:36.920 --> 30:37.720
What is it?

30:39.310 --> 30:40.170
Your Highness.

30:40.750 --> 30:42.110
You look troubled.

30:42.550 --> 30:43.720
I've made something delicious.

30:43.720 --> 30:44.790
How about we…

30:44.790 --> 30:45.310
No need.

30:49.350 --> 30:50.590
Should the Court of Judicial Review

30:50.590 --> 30:51.830
assist in the assassination case?

30:51.830 --> 30:52.590
No need.

30:52.590 --> 30:54.070
No for this, no for that—

30:54.070 --> 30:55.160
what do you want?

30:56.350 --> 30:57.280
Here's the plan:

30:57.830 --> 30:59.750
Go find three death-row convicts.

30:59.750 --> 31:01.160
Then dress them up like Li Shiliu,

31:01.160 --> 31:02.720
Yunlong, and Shanhu.

31:03.550 --> 31:05.700
We'll say they impersonated men
from Waning River Crescent

31:05.700 --> 31:07.500
to carry out the assassination.

31:09.030 --> 31:09.830
I got it.

31:10.390 --> 31:12.640
You want to clear
Waning River Crescent's name.

31:12.640 --> 31:13.830
What about Chu Guihong?

31:13.830 --> 31:15.000
Should we say he's the mastermind

31:15.000 --> 31:16.350
behind this and take him down?

31:16.350 --> 31:17.200
No need.

31:18.510 --> 31:20.170
I'm afraid if we keep digging,

31:20.270 --> 31:21.960
we'll end up dragging in
Waning River Crescent

31:21.960 --> 31:22.960
and Song Yi…

31:28.590 --> 31:29.660
I got it again.

31:31.550 --> 31:32.240
You not only

31:32.240 --> 31:34.550
want to clear
Waning River Crescent's name

31:34.550 --> 31:37.010
but also to protect
Miss Song and her family.

31:40.270 --> 31:41.030
Anything else?

31:41.030 --> 31:42.230
If not, you may leave.

31:43.550 --> 31:44.410
Your Highness,

31:44.440 --> 31:46.700
that was a gift from Miss Song, wasn't it?

31:49.620 --> 31:51.070
I know all there is to know

31:51.070 --> 31:52.600
about Miss Song.

31:52.700 --> 31:53.750
I was just

31:53.790 --> 31:54.750
reading up

31:54.750 --> 31:56.480
on her life story.

31:56.510 --> 31:59.370
Maybe Your Highness and I
could go over it together.

31:59.880 --> 32:00.830
You?

32:00.960 --> 32:01.830
Yes!

32:05.160 --> 32:06.240
If you've got questions,

32:06.240 --> 32:07.160
just ask.

32:15.680 --> 32:16.740
Then let me ask you.

32:17.620 --> 32:18.880
What is a script?

32:21.440 --> 32:22.240
It's…

32:25.960 --> 32:27.160
Of course I know that.

32:27.680 --> 32:28.770
It means

32:29.110 --> 32:31.650
to scrape up some capital.

32:31.980 --> 32:34.070
Your Highness, are you opening a shop?

32:34.070 --> 32:36.160
We gather some money first

32:36.160 --> 32:37.680
and then go downtown

32:37.680 --> 32:38.480
to rent a storefront.

32:38.480 --> 32:39.400
Next question:

32:40.110 --> 32:41.320
What's a lead role,

32:42.240 --> 32:43.900
and what's a supporting role?

32:45.310 --> 32:46.310
Oh no.

32:47.160 --> 32:49.810
I know finger rolls, egg rolls,

32:49.860 --> 32:52.070
and even sushi rolls.

32:52.070 --> 32:54.150
But what is a supporting roll?

32:54.440 --> 32:56.790
What is a supporting roll?

32:58.270 --> 32:59.130
Your Highness.

32:59.510 --> 33:00.660
Your Highness, why are you leaving?

33:00.660 --> 33:01.610
Your Highness.

33:01.680 --> 33:03.880
Give me another chance, Your Highness.

33:06.720 --> 33:07.550
Mr. Li,

33:08.480 --> 33:10.940
you want to take part
in the reconstruction?

33:11.590 --> 33:13.050
The chaos in the South City

33:13.310 --> 33:15.030
left many people homeless.

33:16.160 --> 33:17.310
People know me

33:17.310 --> 33:18.830
only as the head of Waning River Crescent

33:18.830 --> 33:20.630
and as a martial-world ruffian.

33:20.920 --> 33:21.960
They don't know

33:22.590 --> 33:24.450
that I also aspire to help people.

33:26.240 --> 33:27.320
Mr. Li,

33:27.550 --> 33:29.210
you truly are kind and gentle,

33:29.720 --> 33:31.510
devoted to helping others.

33:32.750 --> 33:34.240
But this reconstruction

33:34.240 --> 33:35.640
is a government project.

33:36.830 --> 33:38.880
Nan Heng is a sinister man.

33:41.080 --> 33:43.160
If he finds out
you're still in the capital,

33:43.160 --> 33:44.560
you could get in trouble.

33:45.500 --> 33:47.430
The assassination matter is over.

33:47.920 --> 33:49.350
I don't know who helped clear

33:49.350 --> 33:51.080
Waning River Crescent's name,

33:51.640 --> 33:53.840
but since the court has closed the case,

33:54.030 --> 33:55.550
I'm in the clear now.

33:56.640 --> 33:58.440
I can't live my whole life in fear

33:59.160 --> 34:00.830
just because of one setback.

34:01.510 --> 34:02.240
But...

34:02.240 --> 34:02.970
Don't worry.

34:03.350 --> 34:05.300
I've lived in the capital for years.

34:05.300 --> 34:06.950
I know how to protect myself.

34:08.270 --> 34:09.900
Though Nan Heng…

34:12.360 --> 34:14.280
is a sinister,

34:14.320 --> 34:15.440
ruthless man

34:15.800 --> 34:17.610
who's also powerful,

34:17.670 --> 34:18.920
meticulous,

34:19.600 --> 34:21.060
incredibly intelligent,

34:21.219 --> 34:22.150
and super…

34:25.000 --> 34:25.590
I...

34:25.590 --> 34:26.409
Anyway,

34:27.550 --> 34:28.880
since I already promised

34:28.880 --> 34:30.739
to work with you against Nan Heng,

34:30.889 --> 34:32.750
I won't just sit back and watch.

34:33.000 --> 34:33.670
So,

34:33.670 --> 34:35.150
I'll see the reconstruction

34:35.150 --> 34:36.710
through to the end.

34:39.710 --> 34:40.510
Mr. Li,

34:41.440 --> 34:42.900
you're such a good person.

34:49.030 --> 34:50.949
You're a true hero—

34:51.070 --> 34:52.480
selfless and caring.

34:53.590 --> 34:55.280
Tomorrow, I'll go with you.

34:58.590 --> 34:59.660
I'll join you

34:59.840 --> 35:01.770
in rebuilding homes for everyone.

35:04.280 --> 35:05.070
Okay.

35:13.230 --> 35:15.760
Sinister and ruthless?

35:17.000 --> 35:18.200
You're acting weird.

35:18.660 --> 35:21.000
I said things I didn't mean
just to gain her trust.

35:21.000 --> 35:22.400
What's weird about that?

35:23.150 --> 35:24.400
Still,

35:24.440 --> 35:25.590
the old you would never have

35:25.590 --> 35:27.400
bad-mouthed the Seventh Prince.

35:27.400 --> 35:28.670
Pretty thrilling, huh?

35:28.670 --> 35:29.920
The past is the past.

35:30.200 --> 35:31.910
Now I'm Li Shiliu.

35:32.440 --> 35:33.760
Is there a problem with that?

35:33.760 --> 35:34.550
No problem.

35:35.550 --> 35:36.750
It's just that

35:36.780 --> 35:38.480
you went all out

35:38.480 --> 35:39.590
to kill her in the past.

35:39.590 --> 35:40.880
But now, you're going all out

35:40.880 --> 35:42.440
to help her.

35:42.800 --> 35:44.710
Li Shiliu, you're such a selfless man—

35:44.710 --> 35:46.710
fixing up homes all on your own.

35:46.950 --> 35:48.280
If I were a woman,

35:48.280 --> 35:50.210
I would've fallen for you ages ago.

35:51.550 --> 35:52.590
First of all,

35:52.710 --> 35:53.760
I'm not like you—

35:54.350 --> 35:55.620
a lazy bum.

35:56.150 --> 35:56.960
Second,

35:57.350 --> 35:58.760
I meant what I said about
rebuilding the homes,

35:58.760 --> 36:00.220
and I'm not doing it alone.

36:00.600 --> 36:03.330
The whole
Waning River Crescent will be helping.

36:05.280 --> 36:06.340
That includes you.

36:10.950 --> 36:11.950
Including me?

36:13.110 --> 36:14.280
I'm so debonair.

36:14.280 --> 36:15.320
Am I really fit for reconstruction work?

36:15.320 --> 36:16.510
Since you're so debonair,

36:16.510 --> 36:17.630
I have to send you out

36:17.630 --> 36:18.740
and draw some attention.

36:18.740 --> 36:21.680
Attention is one thing I never lack.

36:21.890 --> 36:22.750
Your Highness.

36:22.910 --> 36:24.400
If the useless Shangguan won't go,

36:24.400 --> 36:25.960
someone else is ready to step up.

36:25.960 --> 36:26.590
Perfect.

36:27.590 --> 36:29.110
I once joined

36:29.110 --> 36:30.880
the Xuanjia Army on a rebuilding project.

36:30.880 --> 36:32.360
On my days off,

36:32.360 --> 36:33.670
I often visit the Ministry of Works.

36:33.670 --> 36:35.710
I know quite a bit
about reconstruction.

36:35.710 --> 36:36.840
Your Highness, if you're willing…

36:36.840 --> 36:37.770
I'm not willing.

36:39.150 --> 36:40.110
Listen.

36:41.130 --> 36:42.510
From now on, when I'm Li Shiliu,

36:42.510 --> 36:43.280
stay away from me.

36:43.280 --> 36:44.510
Don't arouse suspicion, okay?

36:44.510 --> 36:45.370
Your Highness,

36:45.710 --> 36:47.230
you've been appearing as Li Shiliu

36:47.230 --> 36:48.030
more and more often.

36:48.030 --> 36:49.440
I can't even serve you properly anymore.

36:49.440 --> 36:50.500
I don't need you to.

36:59.840 --> 37:00.630
Bro,

37:01.040 --> 37:02.110
you and I

37:02.110 --> 37:04.590
are just supporting roles
meant to build up his image.

37:04.590 --> 37:05.520
He's the flower;

37:05.800 --> 37:06.840
we're just the foliage.

37:06.840 --> 37:07.440
Got it?

37:11.220 --> 37:14.330
[Hongyun Inn]

37:11.510 --> 37:12.320
Boys!

37:13.000 --> 37:14.230
Chief's glory

37:14.400 --> 37:16.710
is the glory of every Nightwalker.

37:16.900 --> 37:17.920
Chief's love

37:17.920 --> 37:20.050
is also the love of us all!

37:20.150 --> 37:21.440
Helping others

37:21.440 --> 37:22.550
and pursuing justice

37:22.550 --> 37:24.090
is our mission!

37:24.630 --> 37:25.320
Now let's

37:25.320 --> 37:27.230
roll up our sleeves and get to work!

37:27.230 --> 37:28.030
Yes!

37:27.260 --> 37:28.130
[Changxing Cloth Shop]

37:28.360 --> 37:29.150
Let's go!

37:32.200 --> 37:34.160
♪ The pawnshop owner weeps,
counting silver notes ♪

37:34.770 --> 37:37.150
♪ The pledged military order
is now riddled with decay ♪

37:37.710 --> 37:39.840
♪ A wine banner
pierces the midnight haze ♪

37:40.290 --> 37:42.220
♪ A secret stronghold
lies dormant on the canal map ♪

37:58.800 --> 38:02.410
[Hongyun Inn]

38:05.070 --> 38:06.150
Okay, this way.

38:06.230 --> 38:06.840
Put it here.

38:06.840 --> 38:07.510
Here. Okay.

38:07.510 --> 38:08.690
This is a governmental project.

38:08.690 --> 38:10.620
Outsiders shouldn't be meddling.

38:10.800 --> 38:11.760
Clear them out.

38:12.150 --> 38:12.720
Yes.

38:12.740 --> 38:13.400
-Yes.
-Yes.

38:15.030 --> 38:15.840
Chu Guihong,

38:16.440 --> 38:18.440
what on earth are you worried about?

38:19.710 --> 38:20.510
Yimeng,

38:20.770 --> 38:22.510
reconstruction is a matter of the court.

38:22.510 --> 38:24.480
Li Shiliu is just a martial-world ruffian,

38:24.480 --> 38:27.190
and he was involved in the assassination
attempt on the Seventh Prince.

38:27.190 --> 38:28.510
If His Majesty hadn't let it slide,

38:28.510 --> 38:29.920
he'd be a fugitive by now.

38:30.340 --> 38:31.410
How can someone like that

38:31.410 --> 38:32.840
participate in the reconstruction?

38:32.840 --> 38:33.800
It's absurd.

38:35.360 --> 38:36.160
Alright then.

38:37.230 --> 38:38.670
Let me ask you.

38:39.110 --> 38:40.820
What is court business?

38:42.150 --> 38:44.840
Court business
is about the people's livelihood.

38:44.840 --> 38:45.960
And what does that mean?

38:45.960 --> 38:48.510
It means the daily needs

38:48.510 --> 38:49.670
of ordinary folks.

38:50.030 --> 38:52.230
You're a general
stationed at the border all year round.

38:52.230 --> 38:53.110
You don't even know

38:53.110 --> 38:54.710
how much a sack of rice costs.

38:55.360 --> 38:57.880
How could you possibly know better
than Waning River Crescent?

38:57.880 --> 38:58.510
I...

38:58.510 --> 38:59.440
You can't.

39:02.110 --> 39:03.480
But they are different.

39:04.190 --> 39:05.360
The Nightwalkers

39:05.360 --> 39:06.800
have always roamed
the southern part of the city.

39:06.800 --> 39:08.230
They know how many people live there,

39:08.230 --> 39:09.880
what the local customs are like,

39:09.880 --> 39:11.880
and what kind of wood
is cheap and durable.

39:11.880 --> 39:13.240
They know all of that.

39:13.960 --> 39:15.320
So, Chu Guihong,

39:15.710 --> 39:17.590
why turn away free labor

39:17.590 --> 39:18.920
that comes knocking?

39:21.150 --> 39:22.120
Yimeng,

39:22.190 --> 39:23.920
it's not as simple as you think.

39:24.180 --> 39:25.440
If they have ulterior motives,

39:25.440 --> 39:26.320
or…

39:28.070 --> 39:29.190
Or what?

39:35.550 --> 39:36.510
In the end,

39:36.920 --> 39:38.320
you just don't trust him.

39:39.760 --> 39:41.480
Have you forgotten who risked his life

39:41.480 --> 39:42.630
in the fire that day,

39:42.630 --> 39:43.840
leading Waning River Crescent

39:43.840 --> 39:45.500
to save the people in the city?

39:48.840 --> 39:50.250
Yet someone else,

39:50.480 --> 39:51.800
in the middle of the disaster,

39:51.800 --> 39:53.360
was fretting about catching a suspect,

39:53.360 --> 39:54.800
fixing his broken sword,

39:54.800 --> 39:55.660
-and…
-Yimeng.

39:58.510 --> 39:59.400
Enough.

40:06.070 --> 40:06.710
Alright.

40:07.870 --> 40:09.130
I'll have a proper talk

40:09.310 --> 40:11.440
with Mr. Li about the reconstruction.

40:14.480 --> 40:15.150
Really?

40:38.590 --> 40:39.400
Miss Song,

40:40.360 --> 40:41.400
aren't you afraid

40:42.110 --> 40:43.800
I'll tell your friend
from the martial world

40:43.800 --> 40:46.260
about your secret affair
with His Highness?

40:46.590 --> 40:48.070
D-Don't talk nonsense!

40:48.510 --> 40:49.510
When have I ever

40:49.510 --> 40:51.240
had an affair with your master?

40:52.510 --> 40:53.460
In the royal garden,

40:53.460 --> 40:54.320
you two kissed.

40:55.510 --> 40:56.670
In the prince's private garden,

40:56.670 --> 40:57.870
you two kissed again.

40:58.190 --> 40:59.230
All you two ever did was kiss.

40:59.230 --> 40:59.880
Stop.

41:02.760 --> 41:03.440
Well,

41:03.480 --> 41:06.150
every superstar has a shady past,

41:06.150 --> 41:06.840
right?

41:06.840 --> 41:07.550
I understand.

41:07.550 --> 41:09.590
It's not easy being a paparazzo.

41:09.880 --> 41:11.090
You just want

41:11.230 --> 41:12.480
to make some money.

41:16.440 --> 41:17.230
Hush money.

41:17.480 --> 41:18.880
Forget all those kisses,

41:19.880 --> 41:20.950
okay?

41:23.110 --> 41:23.840
Mr. Fugui,

41:23.840 --> 41:24.550
take it.

41:24.550 --> 41:25.320
If anything like this comes up again,

41:25.320 --> 41:26.480
I won't forget you.

41:26.590 --> 41:27.030
Now that I've paid…

41:27.030 --> 41:27.670
Answer me!

41:29.070 --> 41:29.980
What's a superstar?

41:29.980 --> 41:30.970
What's a paparazzo?
